19292::$$$message_0148_0000_0000$$$::...Let's ask her about the truth.[lr]::
19293::$$$message_0148_0000_0001$$$::No one will interfere here. The resumed Holy Grail War won't have an effect all the way out here, either.::
19294::$$$message_0148_0001_0000$$$::Illya's nowhere in sight.[lr]::
19295::$$$message_0148_0001_0001$$$::I'm vaguely confident that she's waiting in the inner courtyard.[lr]::
19296::$$$message_0148_0001_0002$$$::Should I call Illya, or go to her myself?[lr]::
